    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "start": 250,
      "end": 263,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Why EasyTalk?",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 504,
      "end": 700,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Define once, use everywhere\nOne Ruby DSL gives you:\n\n\n\n\njson_schema for docs, OpenAPI, LLM tools, and external validators\n\n\nvalid? / errors (when using EasyTalk::Model) for runtime validation",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 561,
      "end": 572,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "json_schema",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 561,
      "end": 626,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "json_schema for docs, OpenAPI, LLM tools, and external validators",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 629,
      "end": 635,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "valid?",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 629,
      "end": 696,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "valid? / errors (when using EasyTalk::Model) for runtime validation",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 638,
      "end": 644,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "errors",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 657,
      "end": 672,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "EasyTalk::Model",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 703,
      "end": 926,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Stop arguing with JSON Schema’s verbosity\nExpress constraints in Ruby where you already live:\n\n\nproperty :email, String, format: \"email\"\nproperty :age, Integer, minimum: 18\nproperty :tags, T::Array[String], min_items: 1",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 800,
      "end": 924,
      "attrs": {
        "class": "language-ruby"
      },
      "text": "property :email, String, format: \"email\"\nproperty :age, Integer, minimum: 18\nproperty :tags, T::Array[String], min_items: 1",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 929,
      "end": 1244,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Use a richer type system than \"string/integer/object\"\nEasyTalk supports Sorbet-style types and composition:\n\n\n\n\nT.nilable(Type) for nullable fields\n\n\nT::Array[Type] for typed arrays\n\n\nT::Tuple[Type1, Type2, ...] for fixed-position typed arrays\n\n\nT::Boolean\n\n\nT::AnyOf, T::OneOf, T::AllOf for schema composition",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1042,
      "end": 1057,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T.nilable(Type)",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1042,
      "end": 1077,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T.nilable(Type) for nullable fields",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1080,
      "end": 1094,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::Array[Type]",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1080,
      "end": 1111,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::Array[Type] for typed arrays",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1114,
      "end": 1141,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::Tuple[Type1, Type2, ...]",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1114,
      "end": 1173,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::Tuple[Type1, Type2, ...] for fixed-position typed arrays",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1176,
      "end": 1186,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::Boolean",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1176,
      "end": 1186,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::Boolean",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1189,
      "end": 1197,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::AnyOf",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1189,
      "end": 1240,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::AnyOf, T::OneOf, T::AllOf for schema composition",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1199,
      "end": 1207,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::OneOf",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1209,
      "end": 1217,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "T::AllOf",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1247,
      "end": 1433,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Get validations for free (when you want them)\nWith auto_validations enabled (default), schema constraints generate ActiveModel validations—including nested models, even inside arrays.",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "code",
      "start": 1299,
      "end": 1315,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "auto_validations",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1436,
      "end": 1578,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Make API errors consistent\nFormat validation errors as:\n\n\n\n\nflat lists\n\n\nJSON Pointer\n\n\nRFC 7807 problem details\n\n\nJSON:API error objects",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1497,
      "end": 1507,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "flat lists",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1510,
      "end": 1522,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "JSON Pointer",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1525,
      "end": 1549,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "RFC 7807 problem details",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1552,
      "end": 1574,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "JSON:API error objects",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "li",
      "start": 1581,
      "end": 1737,
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "LLM tool/function schemas without a second schema layer\nUse the same contract to generate JSON Schema for function/tool calling. See RubyLLM Integration.",
      "clipped": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "start": 1715,
      "end": 1734,
      "attrs": {
        "href": "#rubyllm-integration"
      },
      "text": "RubyLLM Integration",
      "clipped": false
    },
